OL,3,ASecond night of drone disruption at
OL,4,AJersey Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FPeople at Jersey Airport have said they
OL,7,Fare frustrated and angry that
OL,8,F"unauthorised drone" activity caused
OL,9,Fmore flight cancellations for a second
OL,10,Fnight in a row.
OL,12,FAt 20:05 on Saturday Jersey Airport
OL,13,Fsaid it was "experiencing
OL,14,Fdisruption.... affecting inbound
OL,15,Fflights as a result of further drone
OL,16,Factivity in the vicinity of the
OL,17,Fairfield".
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
