OL,3,ASecond night of drone disruption at
OL,4,AJersey Airport
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates of Jersey Police are
OL,7,Finvestigating the incidents and
OL,8,Fofficers have appealed to anyone with
OL,9,Finformation about who is responsible to
OL,10,Fcome forward.
OL,12,FInsp Rob McCallum said it was believed
OL,13,F"two or three" drones had entered the
OL,14,Frestricted airspace, but they were not
OL,15,Fthought to be linked to terrorism.
